<title>SRI LANKA: Weather-Scattered showers seen over Sri Lanka.</title>
<headline>Weather-Scattered showers seen over Sri Lanka.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's metereological department forecast scattered showers in the Western, Central, Sabaragamuwa and Southern provinces for Saturday.</p>
<p>It said there was little rain in the hydro catchment areas in the 24 hours ending Friday morning.</p>
